msgid "Empty: Cloudflare. Otherwise the address of a LibreSpeed server: the folder with garbage.php and empty.php, such as http://speed.example.com/backend/. Over https uploads go in small requests and read lower."
msgstr "留空使用 Cloudflare。也可以填 LibreSpeed 服务器的地址，即 garbage.php 和 empty.php 所在的目录，例如 http://speed.example.com/backend/。使用 https 时上传分成小请求发送，测得的上传速率偏低。"

